OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to consider borough-wide
OL,4,AHMO rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FHinckley and Bosworth Borough Council
OL,7,Fis set to consider proposals to tighten
OL,8,Fplanning rules on houses in multiple
OL,9,Foccupancy (HMOs) across the borough.
OL,11,FThe authority is recommended to approve
OL,12,Fa proposal to launch a consultation on
OL,13,Fintroducing a borough-wide Article 4
OL,14,Fdirection on Wednesday.
OL,16,FA direction would mean planning
OL,17,Fpermission would be required before any
OL,18,Fnew HMOs could be created, the council
OL,19,Fsaid. At present, small HMOs of up to
OL,20,Fsix people can be created without
OL,21,Fplanning permission under permitted
OL,22,Fdevelopment rules.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
