OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to consider borough-wide
OL,4,AHMO rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council previously introduced
OL,7,FArticle 4 directions for defined areas
OL,8,Fof Hinckley, Barwell and Earl Shilton,
OL,9,Fbut said this led to HMO activity
OL,10,Femerging in other areas.
